<meta property="schema:accessibilitySummary">Converted from LaTeX by relatex. The text is reflowable, in the reading order of the source, with a table of contents and navigation by headings. Its 2 formulas are written as MathML. The page numbers of the print edition (the PDF named as the source) are marked in the text and listed in a page list. Every figure has a text alternative. 1 figure has a long description after the figure, shown on demand. The publication conforms to EPUB Accessibility 1.1 - WCAG 2.2 Level AA, as established by the export's accessibility checks.</meta>
<meta property="dcterms:conformsTo">EPUB Accessibility 1.1 - WCAG 2.2 Level AA</meta>
<meta property="a11y:certifiedBy">relatex accessibility checks (axe-core and structural checks of the export)</meta>
